    {"@type":"Question","name":"How many floors can I build on a commercial plot?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on the society and the plot. In DHA Lahore, 4 and 8 Marla plots are allowed B+G+M+2F in Phases I to IV and B+G+M+4F from Phase V. LDA commercial centres allow B+G+5 on 4 to 8 Marla. CDA controls commercial plots by floor area ratio rather than floor count. Bahria Town sets floors per plot."}},
