<!-- ═══ TIMELINE ═══ -->
<section class="dark" id="timeline">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Programme</p>
    <h2>How a plaza is built, stage by stage</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">Design and approval take three to four months before mobilisation in most societies; LDA converted plots can take four to eight. In DHA, the building must be completed within two years of drawing approval.</p>

    <ol class="timeline">
      <li><div class="tl-pct">3–4 mo</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Design and approval</h4><p>Soil investigation, concept and 3D elevation, submission set with structural, MEP and fire drawings, then scrutiny by the society or authority.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="tl-pct">15–45 d</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Mobilisation and excavation</h4><p>Site setup, excavation permission, shoring and excavation to formation level.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="tl-pct">45–90 d</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Each basement</h4><p>Raft, retaining walls with waterproofing, and the slab over. Add 20–30 days where RCC piling is required.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="tl-pct">21–35 d</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Ground floor and mezzanine</h4><p>Ground columns and slab, then the partial mezzanine slab over the shops.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="tl-pct">21–30 d</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Each upper slab</h4><p>One slab cycle per floor, including shuttering and the 7-day strike of sides. Masonry follows two floors behind.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="tl-pct">20–35 d</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Roof, mumty and machine room</h4><p>Roof slab, parapet, stair mumty, lift machine room and roof waterproofing.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="tl-pct">3–9 mo</div><div class="tl-body"><h4>Finishing and handover</h4><p>Shell &amp; core or full finishing, starting on the lower floors while the top slab is cast, then testing, commissioning, snagging and handover.</p></div></li>
    </ol>

    <h3 style="margin-top:44px;font-size:20px">Completion time — DHA reference plazas</h3>
    <p class="section-lede" style="font-size:15px">Calendar months from mobilisation to handover with standard finishing. The estimator works out the programme for any number of basements and floors.</p>
    <div class="tablewrap" style="margin-top:20px;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);background:transparent">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Plot / phase</th>
            <th>Configuration</th>
            <th class="num">Gray structure</th>
            <th class="num">Turnkey total</th>
            <th class="num">Without basement</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="timeBody"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="tbl-note" style="color:#7FA0C4">Durations assume timely payments, timely approval of drawings and material selections, and normal weather. Finishing overlaps the structural programme from the lower floors upward.</p>
  </div>
</section>

